---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'August 27, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="About USAPrizes.com: who we are, what we cover, and how we keep our lottery results and sweepstakes casino reviews accurate."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'About Us', href: '/about/' }]} />
      <h1>About USAPrizes.com</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p>
        USAPrizes.com is an independent informational site covering two things: official U.S.
        lottery results (Powerball, Mega Millions, and eventually individual state games), and
        honest reviews of the legal sweepstakes casinos operating in the United States.
      </p>

      <h2>What we are</h2>
      <p>
        We are a content and review publication. We do not sell lottery tickets, do not operate
        a sweepstakes casino, and do not process real-money wagers. Where we link to a
        sweepstakes casino operator, that link may be an affiliate link &mdash; see our
        <a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy</a> for how that works and how it does
        not influence our ratings.
      </p>

      <h2>What we are not</h2>
      <p>
        We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated on behalf of any U.S. state lottery
        commission, the Multi-State Lottery Association, or any sweepstakes casino operator we
        review. Lottery numbers published on this site are sourced from public data feeds and
        are provided for informational purposes only; always verify results against your
        official state lottery before taking any action on a ticket.
      </p>

      <h2>Who's behind this site</h2>
      <p>
        USAPrizes.com is founded, written, and maintained by <strong>Mark Ora</strong> &mdash; not an
        anonymous "team." Full details on our review process, including where hands-on account
        testing has and hasn't been completed yet for each brand, are on our
        <a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy</a> page.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions, corrections, or press inquiries: <a href="mailto:hello@usaprizes.com">hello@usaprizes.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
